            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/orders",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "description": "NFR#1: Uses DB transaction + lockForUpdate() to prevent race conditions on stock.\nNFR#3: Dispatches 3 async jobs after placing order:\n  - GenerateInvoiceJob\n  - SendOrderNotificationJob\n  - NotifyLowStockJob (per item)\n\nRequires queue worker to be running: php artisan queue:work"
